E[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2425130978,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[750360204]},{"nodeId":750360204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4073614538,"text":"Hmm, let Paimon see... Is this some sorta seed? Huh. Didn't think we'd find something like that in this barren ground...","nextNodeIds":[750360205]},{"nodeId":750360205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1640379410,"text":"Rrrawr?","nextNodeIds":[750360206]},{"nodeId":750360206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1044676962,"text":"That said, this doesn't look all that valuable...","nextNodeIds":[750360207]},{"nodeId":750360207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":4220104426,"text":"Roar...","nextNodeIds":[750360208,750360209]},{"nodeId":750360208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":245378018,"text":"Seeds contain infinite possibilities...","nextNodeIds":[750360210]},{"nodeId":750360210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1715763282,"text":"Still, this place must have been abandoned for ages. The soil looks so hard, too... Could this seed really still be alive?","nextNodeIds":[750360211]},{"nodeId":750360211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1599360402,"text":"Rawr...?","nextNodeIds":[750360212]},{"nodeId":750360212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2077869690,"text":"Are you upset? ... Well, sometimes it's hard to say — some seeds just won't sprout naturally...","nextNodeIds":[750360213]},{"nodeId":750360213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2951042874,"text":"But we could replant it and see what happens. Maybe it just hasn't sprouted yet? Maybe the hole wasn't well dug, or it didn't get enough nutrients.","nextNodeIds":[750360214]},{"nodeId":750360214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":226955778,"text":"So it might grow if we plant it properly! Hehe, what might grow from it? A giant Grainfruit, maybe? Or... Y'know, a Cacahuatl with a super strong aroma might be awesome too!","nextNodeIds":[750360215]},{"nodeId":750360215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":503757866,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[750360216]},{"nodeId":750360216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":25911778,"text":"Or maybe a Whopperflower...","nextNodeIds":[750360217]},{"nodeId":750360217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1549753658,"text":"Hey, come on! Stop being a killjoy!","nextNodeIds":[750360218]},{"nodeId":750360218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2526015274,"text":"That said, what sort of nutrients do plants from Natlan need? ... Anyway, let's get this planted first!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":750360209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2328615970,"text":"You never know, it might grow into something impressive!","nextNodeIds":[750360210]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7503602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["21567"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNG